# Entity Tagging System Outputs

This directory stores generated classification reports and analysis outputs.

## Structure

```
outputs/
├── hotels/           # Hotel classification outputs
├── churches/         # Church classification outputs
└── schools/          # School of Arts classification outputs
```

## Contents (Not Committed)

Generated files stored here but excluded from git:
- Collection results (`*_mentions.json`)
- Classification prompts (`*_classification_prompt.txt`)
- Generated reports (`*_classifications.md`)
- Approved classifications (`approved_classifications.md`)

## Workflow

1. Scripts generate outputs here
2. Review and approve classifications
3. Apply approved classifications to taxonomy
4. Archive final approved versions if needed

See `../workflows/` for detailed workflow guides.
